      <strong style="color:var(--cream);">
      affordability + realistic schedule + employer relevance +
      portfolio evidence + skill progression
      </strong>.
      The cheapest course is not automatically the best course.
      The most prestigious course is not automatically the best course.
      The strongest choice is the one that can realistically move a person
